        "1961790": {
          "comments": [
            {
              "attachment_id": null,
              "author": "ctanase@mozilla.com",
              "bug_id": 1961790,
              "count": 0,
              "creation_time": "2025-04-22T11:56:59Z",
              "creator": "ctanase@mozilla.com",
              "id": 17454322,
              "is_private": false,
              "raw_text": "**Environment:**\nOperating system: Windows 10\nFirefox version: Firefox 137/139\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Go to https://translate.google.com/\n2. Select english as source language.\n3. Click on the microphone button.\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nVoice input can be used.\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nVoice input cannot be used, unsupported.\n\n**Notes:**\n- Reproduces regardless of the status of ETP\n- Reproduces in firefox-nightly, and firefox-release\n- Does not reproduce in chrome\n\nCreated from https://github.com/webcompat/web-bugs/issues/152336",
              "reactions": {},
              "tags": [],
              "text": "**Environment:**\nOperating system: Windows 10\nFirefox version: Firefox 137/139\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Go to https://translate.google.com/\n2. Select english as source language.\n3. Click on the microphone button.\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nVoice input can be used.\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nVoice input cannot be used, unsupported.\n\n**Notes:**\n- Reproduces regardless of the status of ETP\n- Reproduces in firefox-nightly, and firefox-release\n- Does not reproduce in chrome\n\nCreated from https://github.com/webcompat/web-bugs/issues/152336",
              "time": "2025-04-22T11:56:59Z"
            },
            {
